. 2 days later, he got back to me, in a very friendly and well-thought-out email. In this email, he told me that he had already been working on adding the first feature, and the other had been added to his todo list. Given that he is a solo developer, and also working on another up-and-coming app at the same time, I'd say his support services are the best I've ever seen, from any app on the app store.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-4" data-index="4" aria-hidden="true"></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-5" data-index="5" aria-hidden="true"></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-6" data-index="6" aria-hidden="true"></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-7" data-index="7" aria-hidden="true"></li> </ul> <button aria-label="Next Page" type="button" class="shelf-grid-nav__arrow shelf-grid-nav__arrow--right svelte-133ytgj" data-testid="shelf-button-right" style="--offset: 0px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 9 31" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5.275 29.46a1.61 1.61 0 0 0 1.456 1.077c1.018 0 1.772-.737 1.772-1.737 0-.526-.277-1.186-.449-1.62l-4.68-11.912L8.05 3.363c.172-.442.45-1.116.45-1.625A1.702 1.702 0 0 0 6.728.002a1.603 1.603 0 0 0-1.456 1.09L.675 12.774c-.301.775-.677 1.744-.677 2.495 0 .754.376 1.705.677 2.498L5.272 29.46Z"></path></svg></button></div> </section> </div> </section> <section id="mostRecentVersion" data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" aria-label="What’s New" class="shelf svelte-1svznay    padding-top padding-bottom"><div slot="title" class="title-container svelte-qq59rp"><button>  <div class="title-action-wrapper svelte-1oivr99">  <div class="link-contents svelte-1oivr99"><h2 class="shelf-title svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-