se history, check out your stats and see how you've improved over time.\nDidn't have time to track a previous day? No problem, you can easily update any record in the past.\n\nFeatures:\n- Build good habits, break bad ones\n- Daily, weekly, and monthly goals\n- Get habit ideas with private, on-device Apple Intelligence (where available)\n- Track even overachieved goals\n- Track time-based goals with timers\n- Powerful statistics with heatmaps\n- Habit lists\n- Habit notes\n- 2,500+ icons and emojis, with support for Genmoji and custom stickers\n- Dark Mode and appearance customization\n- Health app integration\n- Reminders, alarms, app badge, and Health app notifications\n- Interactive widgets for Home Screen, Lock Screen, and StandBy mode\n- Interactive Dynamic Island & Live Activities\n- Control Center widgets\n- Apple Watch complications and the Smart Stack widget\n- Export to a CSV file\n- Siri Shortcuts\n- iCloud backup & sync\n- Available on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.awesome-habits.com/terms-conditions\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.awesome-habits.com/privacy-policy","rating":4.8,"ratingCount":"896","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1514915737&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=885801770"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1514915737"},{"locationPosition":4,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Awesome Habits: Habit Tracker","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1514915737"},{"locationPosition":12,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"1514915737","eventTyp